(32, 'Past Event-September 2018- Dubai, UAE', 'Dubai', NULL, 'event_image-63ef6bd05deac.jpg,event_image-63ef6bd05e14f.jpg,event_image-63ef6bd05e214.jpg,event_image-63ef6bd05e2de.jpg,event_image-63ef6bd05e396.jpg,event_image-63ef6bd05e44e.jpg,event_image-63ef6bd05e503.jpg,event_image-63ef6bd05e5b9.jpg,event_image-63ef6bd05e6e1.jpg,event_image-63ef61167f9b4.jpg', 'event_video-63ef61c62d266.mp4', 50, 50, '50', 50, NULL, '5', 4, '<p>Successfully happened in 2018 with almost 50 female and 50 male candidates. Parents were also invited.</p>', '<p>Great results, many have married to date through this event, which was held in 2018 in a famous hotel in Dubai.&nbsp;</p>', '2018-11-09', 0, '100.00', NULL, '50.00', 1, 'United Arab Emirates', '2023-02-17 05:42:22', '2023-02-17 06:40:40'),
(33, 'Upcoming Event-Feb 28, Dubai, UAE', 'Dubai, Al Barsha', NULL, 'event_image-63ef742a6391d.jpg', 'event_video-63ef7789d9123.mp4', 25, 30, '3', 2, NULL, '11,12,13,14', 2, '<p>Join our next event in Dubai, all are welcome and do not forget to bring your parents!</p>', '<p>We are pleased to announce another event in Dubai that is taking place after Pandemaic. We welcome all members who are serious about getting married and ready to settle down soon. We have limited number of seats left, 40 seats are already filled and only 3 seats are left. I would advise to grab the opportunity before someone else does. We wish you good luck in finding the right partner, DONT MISS OUT!</p>', '2023-02-28', 1, '10.00', NULL, '20.00', 1, 'United Arab Emirates', '2023-02-17 07:03:46', '2023-02-20 07:52:47');
